e the resource, swing until the carrier is full or the node is empty, carry the load home if there is one, then decide. The same node still has some: done, the caller re-enters with the same arguments. It is empty: the nearest node of its kind becomes the agent''s resource fact and the caller re-enters pointing there. Nothing left: completedGatherOrder = acceptedGatherOrder, and the gather guard turns false.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e7985a25-2ea4-45af-89aa-bda11ee37e67","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"ScriptGraphVariable":{"returnType":"System.Object, mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","function":2,"$id":"104"},"parameters":[{"Name":"target","Type":"UnityEngine.GameObject","Optional":false,"DefaultValue":null}],"resultType":"UnityEngine.Transform","scriptGraphVariables":[{"$ref":"104"}],"comment":"TransformOf(resource)","relations":{"$content":[],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ConnectionCollection`3[[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPortRelation, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null]]"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"defaultValues":{},"LastExecutionStatus":"None","runtimeException":null,"positionRect":{"xMin":1704.0,"yMin":1716.0,"xMax":1854.0,"yMax":1804.0},"guid":"791eec11-864f-4e30-9886-a7e31e6fd163","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.VisualScriptGraphVariable","$id":"103"},{"$ref":"27"},{"ScriptGraphVariable":{"returnType":"System.Object, mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","function":3,"$id":"111"},"parameters":[{"Name":"like","Type":"UnityEngine.GameObject","Optional":false,"DefaultValue":null}],"resultType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","scriptGraphVariables":[{"$ref":"111"}],"comment":"NearestResource(resource)"